<td id="S4.T1.13.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:1.4pt 5.0pt;" colspan="8"><span id="S4.T1.13.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">GeoAux Categories (Acc %)</span></td></tr>
