<section id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">RL Hyperparameters.</h4>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We fine-tune the model with LaGDPO, a KL-regularized PPO-style update with group-decomposed advantages.
Table <a href="#Pt0.A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ RL Hyperparameters. ‣ 0.A.2 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix 0.A Appendix ‣ LatentGeo: Learnable Auxiliary Constructions in Latent Space for Multimodal Geometric Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> lists the main hyperparameters.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
