<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.77em;">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#F7F9FB;">Representative Case Study Example</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.43 11.85)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.43em;--ltx-fo-height:40.91em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="566.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 566.11)" width="490.25"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.43em;">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Knowledge.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Analytic Coordinate Geometry.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Visual Operation.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Analytic Overlay.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Question.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Hint: Please solve the problem and provide the final boxed answer as the uppercase option letter only, e.g., </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{A}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In parallelogram </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ABCD" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ABCD</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, three vertices are </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A(-1,0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B(-2,-3)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B(-2,-3)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, and </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C(2,-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C(2,-1)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">. What are the coordinates of </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">?</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Options: A. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(3,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(3,1)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  B. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(3,2)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(3,2)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  C. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(3,3)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(3,3)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  D. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(3,4)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">4</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(3,4)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Question Image.</span></span><img src="2603.12166v1/geoaux_1389.png" id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:154/154;" width="154" height="154" alt="Refer to caption">
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Model Response.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Since </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ABCD" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ABCD</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> is a parallelogram, the diagonals </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="AC" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">AC</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> and </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="BD" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">BD</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> bisect each other. Therefore, the midpoint of </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="AC" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">AC</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> equals the midpoint of </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="BD" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">BD</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p4.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;|latent_start|&gt;&lt;|latent_pad|&gt;…&lt;|latent_pad|&gt;&lt;|latent_end|&gt;</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Compute the midpoint of <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="AC" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">AC</annotation></semantics></math>: the midpoint formula gives <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(\frac{-1+2}{2},\frac{0+(-1)}{2}\right)=\left(\frac{1}{2},-\frac{1}{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(\frac{-1+2}{2},\frac{0+(-1)}{2}\right)=\left(\frac{1}{2},-\frac{1}{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D=(x,y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">D</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D=(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>. Then the midpoint of <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="BD" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">BD</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(\frac{-2+x}{2},\frac{-3+y}{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">(</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(\frac{-2+x}{2},\frac{-3+y}{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Setting the two midpoints equal gives the system <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{-2+x}{2}=\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{-2+x}{2}=\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{-3+y}{2}=-\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{-3+y}{2}=-\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>. Solve the first: <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-2+x=1\Rightarrow x=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-2+x=1\Rightarrow x=3</annotation></semantics></math>. Solve the second: <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-3+y=-1\Rightarrow y=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-3+y=-1\Rightarrow y=2</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D=(3,2)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">D</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D=(3,2)</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, the correct option is <math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{B}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Correct Answer.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p6.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">B</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{B}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.pic1.p6.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 17</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A1.F17.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative case study from <span id="Pt0.A1.F17.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">GeoAux</span>.<span id="Pt0.A1.F17.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> </span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A1.F18" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="666.66" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 480.31 666.66" width="480.31"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,666.66) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#CCD8E2;" fill="#CCD8E2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.98 L 0 662.68 C 0 664.88 1.78 666.66 3.98 666.66 L 476.34 666.66 C 478.53 666.66 480.31 664.88 480.31 662.68 L 480.31 3.98 C 480.31 1.78 478.53 0 476.34 0 L 3.98 0 C 1.78 0 0 1.78 0 3.98 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5F8FB;" fill="#F5F8FB" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 3.98 L 0.83 640.55 L 479.48 640.55 L 479.48 3.98 C 479.48 2.24 478.07 0.83 476.34 0.83 L 3.98 0.83 C 2.24 0.83 0.83 2.24 0.83 3.98 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4F6473;" fill="#4F6473" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 641.38 L 0.83 662.68 C 0.83 664.42 2.24 665.83 3.98 665.83 L 476.34 665.83 C 478.07 665.83 479.48 664.42 479.48 662.68 L 479.48 641.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.43 650.49)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.77em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="425.77"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.77em;">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#F7F9FB;">Representative Case Study Example</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.43 11.85)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.43em;--ltx-fo-height:44.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="618.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 618.46)" width="490.25"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.43em;">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Knowledge.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Functional Graph Geometry.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Visual Operation.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Analytic Overlay.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Question.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Hint: Please solve the problem and provide the final boxed answer as the uppercase option letter only, e.g., </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{A}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The arch of a bridge is parabolic. When the arch apex is 2 m above the water surface, the water surface width is 4 m. If the water surface drops by 1 m, by how much does the water surface width increase?</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Options: A. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\,m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\,m</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  B. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\,m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\,m</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  C. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(2\sqrt{6}-4)\,m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">4</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(2\sqrt{6}-4)\,m</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  D. </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\sqrt{6}-2)\,m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">6</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\sqrt{6}-2)\,m</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Question Image.</span></span><img src="2603.12166v1/geoaux_1618.png" id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:154/154;" width="154" height="154" alt="Refer to caption">
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Model Response.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Set up a coordinate system with the vertex of the parabola at the origin and the axis of symmetry along the </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">-axis. Then the parabola is </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=ax^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=ax^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> with </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a&lt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">. The water surface at the initial level is the line </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-2</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, and the water surface at the final level is the line </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-3</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p4.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;|latent_start|&gt;&lt;|latent_pad|&gt;…&lt;|latent_pad|&gt;&lt;|latent_end|&gt;</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">At the initial level <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-2</annotation></semantics></math>, the water surface is the line <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-2</annotation></semantics></math>. The intersection with the parabola is at <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-2</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-2=ax^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-2=ax^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, giving <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=\pm\sqrt{-\frac{2}{a}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=\pm\sqrt{-\frac{2}{a}}</annotation></semantics></math>. The width is <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\sqrt{-\frac{2}{a}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\sqrt{-\frac{2}{a}}</annotation></semantics></math>. At the final level <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-3</annotation></semantics></math>, the intersection is at <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=-3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">y</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=-3</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-3=ax^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-3=ax^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, giving <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=\pm\sqrt{-\frac{3}{a}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">x</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">±</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=\pm\sqrt{-\frac{3}{a}}</annotation></semantics></math>. The new width is <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\sqrt{-\frac{3}{a}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\sqrt{-\frac{3}{a}}</annotation></semantics></math>. The increase in width is <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 2\sqrt{-\frac{3}{a}}-2\sqrt{-\frac{2}{a}}=2\sqrt{-\frac{1}{a}}\Big(\sqrt{3}-\sqrt{2}\Big)=2\sqrt{6}-4." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.780em" minsize="1.780em">(</mo><mrow><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></msqrt><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" maxsize="1.780em" minsize="1.780em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 2\sqrt{-\frac{3}{a}}-2\sqrt{-\frac{2}{a}}=2\sqrt{-\frac{1}{a}}\Big(\sqrt{3}-\sqrt{2}\Big)=2\sqrt{6}-4.</annotation></semantics></math> Therefore, the correct option is <math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">C</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{C}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#354C5E;">Correct Answer.</span><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p6.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><math id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathsize="0.900em">C</mi></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{C}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.pic1.p6.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 18</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A1.F18.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative case study from <span id="Pt0.A1.F18.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">GeoAux</span>.<span id="Pt0.A1.F18.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> </span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
